jcode — a browser version of jewcodegen

This product includes software derived from jewcodegen
(https://fergie.omer.land/omer/jewcodegen), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. See LICENSE.

Changes from the original:
- js/jewcode.js is a JavaScript port of pkg/jcg/jewcode (Go). The token builder,
  validation, addition/grouping logic and block rendering follow the original
  function by function. Representation changes: levels are stored as their
  modifier string (null = omitted) and profiles are plain objects. renderBlock
  can optionally wrap long lines.
- js/wizard.js reimplements the question flow of pkg/jcg/wizard as a web page.
  The Hebrew and language level questions follow their own questions instead of
  coming at the end of the stage.
- test/jewcode.test.mjs ports the original Go test cases.
- New, not in the original: js/parse.js (block → answers, for editing a decoded
  block), js/state.js (share links), js/decode.js (decode page).
